# JudeanFloraV1; canonical UE cm (X east, +Y south, Z up), written with Y reflected and triangle winding reversed for the legacy OBJ importer adapter. One o object, no g groups, so the importer creates exactly one material slot.
# olive (Olea europaea), StreetTreesV1 seed 3, LOD2 bark
# height 4.5-9.0 m, crown 4.0-7.5 m; source: Zohary, M., Plants of the Bible (Cambridge University Press, 1982), species entry Olea europaea; street and garden specimens run 4.5-9 m
# branching is recursive with da Vinci child radii; leaf sprays are anchored to branch tips. Stylised habit, not a survey of any tree.
o SM_StreetTreesV1_Olive_S3_L2_Bark
